---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL
---

<Layout title="About" headerAlt={true}>
  <!-- ============================================
       HERO
       ============================================ -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-28 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-4">About Kalterra</p>
          <h1 class="text-gray-900 mb-8">Exceptional Real Estate</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:pt-4">
          <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Kalterra is derived from the Greek word <em>kalitera</em> (the best) and the Latin word <em>terra</em> (land). True to our name, we acquire great real estate and transform it into exceptional communities. Through a data-driven and disciplined investment strategy, we identify the most attractive Texas submarkets and pursue opportunities across the full lifecycle of multifamily real estate &mdash; from acquisition of stabilized assets to select development opportunities.
            </p>
            <p>
              Projects come alive through a meticulous operational philosophy. The needs of our residents and communities inform every decision, whether enhancing the performance of an existing asset or executing a new investment. Alignment with partners who share our vision and values is central to our success.
            </p>
            <p>
              Multifamily ownership requires operational discipline, local market knowledge, and financial expertise. At Kalterra, we bring these together through thoughtful acquisitions and hands-on asset management to create long-term value.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About imagery -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}assets/images/about/kalterra-image-1.jpg`} alt="Kalterra property" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}assets/images/about/great-room.webp`} alt="Interior living space" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}assets/images/about/property-twilight.webp`} alt="Property at twilight" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================
       CORE VALUES
       ============================================ -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-4">Our Core Values</p>
        <h2 class="text-gray-900">The Foundation of Everything We Do</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 rounded-full bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-black font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Cultivate Community</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 rounded-full bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-black font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Unwavering Honesty</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 rounded-full bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-black font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Uncompromising Grit</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 rounded-full bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M11.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.519 4.674a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.915c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.976 2.888a1 1 0 00-.363 1.118l1.518 4.674c.3.922-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.976-2.888a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.976 2.888c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.518-4.674a1 1 0 00-.363-1.118l-3.976-2.888c-.784-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h4.914a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.519-4.674z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-black font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Individually Outstanding</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 rounded-full bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-black font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Unbeatable as a Team</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-2xl text-gray-900 font-light mt-16">
        Our work is our <span class="text-gold font-semibold">craft</span>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================
       CAPABILITIES
       ============================================ -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-4">Our Capabilities</p>
        <h2 class="text-gray-900">Full-Cycle Multifamily Expertise</h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Capital Markets -->
      <div class="py-14 border-b border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-gold mb-6">Capital Markets</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Kalterra has an extensive background in capital formation and a strong ability to access the debt and equity providers to fund our investments. Our underwriting, risk assessment and market analysis expertise allows us to identify the most advantageous financing options available. Through established relationships with a broad spectrum of capital providers, we can minimize risk and maximize returns for our stakeholders.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Acquisitions -->
      <div class="py-14 border-b border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-gold mb-6">Acquisitions</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-12">
          Kalterra acquires multifamily assets across high-growth Texas markets where strong fundamentals, operational expertise, and disciplined capital deployment can unlock long-term value. Leveraging deep market knowledge and an institutional investment process, we target opportunities where thoughtful execution, strategic capital improvements, and active asset management can enhance performance and drive durable NOI growth. Our approach combines rigorous underwriting, local market insight, and a development-informed perspective to identify assets with clear pathways to value creation while maintaining a strong focus on downside protection.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-8">Our Acquisition Strategy</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-md p-6 transition-all hover:border-gold hover:shadow-md">
            <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Targeting Institutional-Quality Assets</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We focus on well-located multifamily communities with strong underlying fundamentals and functional unit mixes in high-growth Texas markets.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-md p-6 transition-all hover:border-gold hover:shadow-md">
            <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Disciplined Investment Process</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every opportunity undergoes comprehensive underwriting, including detailed lease audits, operating analysis, and multiple scenario stress tests to ensure strong risk-adjusted returns.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-md p-6 transition-all hover:border-gold hover:shadow-md">
            <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Value Creation Through Execution</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We implement targeted value-add strategies such as in-unit renovations, washer/dryer additions, bulk Wi-Fi programs, and operational enhancements to increase revenue and improve resident experience.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-md p-6 transition-all hover:border-gold hover:shadow-md">
            <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Development-Informed Perspective</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our background in ground-up development allows us to evaluate assets relative to replacement cost and apply builder-level discipline to capital planning and execution.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-md p-6 transition-all hover:border-gold hover:shadow-md">
            <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Market-Driven Investment Approach</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We prioritize submarkets supported by strong population growth, job creation, and favorable supply-demand dynamics.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-md p-6 transition-all hover:border-gold hover:shadow-md">
            <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Aligned Partnerships</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Kalterra invests alongside institutional and private capital partners, ensuring alignment and a shared commitment to long-term value creation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Development -->
      <div class="py-14 border-b border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-gold mb-6">Development</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Kalterra's expertise in site identification, market research, and analytic-driven design enables us to deliver multifamily properties that are tailor fit to their communities, thereby maximizing value for our investors. Our internal teams are dedicated to the entire development process including site selection, entitlement, design, and construction oversight. Our best-in-class design professionals help us continually stay on the forefront of multifamily design, incorporating the latest trends in luxury living.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Asset Management -->
      <div class="py-14 border-b border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-gold mb-6">Asset Management</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Kalterra's asset management function operates at the ownership and portfolio strategy level, distinct from day-to-day property operations. Our asset management team is responsible for driving investment performance, ensuring alignment between the business plan and on-the-ground execution, and maximizing value creation across the portfolio. Core responsibilities include portfolio performance monitoring, investor reporting and communications, capital planning and renovation oversight, market analysis for hold/sell decisions, and disposition strategy. We take a hands-on approach to ensure every asset in our portfolio is positioned for optimal risk-adjusted returns, providing our investors with transparent, data-driven updates throughout the investment lifecycle.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Property Management -->
      <div class="py-14">
        <h3 class="text-gold mb-6">Property Management</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          For our multifamily investments, Kalterra undergoes an extensive vetting process to ensure we partner with the best possible local property management groups for each of our projects. Our asset management teams take a hands-on approach with our property management partners to ensure we are maximizing value. We work with our property management partners to ensure our branding, collateral, website, and a custom marketing plan is in place months before the lease-up begins.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-20 lg:py-28 border-t border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-gray-900 mb-6">Want to know more?</h2>
      <a
        href={`${base}contact/`}
        class="inline-block px-10 py-4 bg-gold text-black font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-gold-light transition-colors"
      >
        Contact Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
